[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8640.63, "timestamp": "02:24:00", "text": "チームワークが必要なのです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8643.11, "timestamp": "02:24:03", "text": "真実。   そう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8643.51, "timestamp": "02:24:03", "text": "思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8655.67, "timestamp": "02:24:15", "text": "。  [音楽] 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8661.75, "timestamp": "02:24:21", "text": "それを何と呼ぶのか、ずっと続けていたと思います。   えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8668.79, "timestamp": "02:24:28", "text": "本当のゲームはただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8671.99, "timestamp": "02:24:31", "text": "撃つだけではなく、他の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8675.75, "timestamp": "02:24:35", "text": "要素もあると思うんだけど、それがいいよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8676.79, "timestamp": "02:24:36", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8678.469, "timestamp": "02:24:38", "text": "ヘリコプターみたいなやつ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8680.71, "timestamp": "02:24:40", "text": "うん。 あなたが楽しんで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8683.67, "timestamp": "02:24:43", "text": "プレイしている限りはそれでいいんです。 うん。 例えば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8686.07, "timestamp": "02:24:46", "text": "ヘリコプターを使って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8689.51, "timestamp": "02:24:49", "text": "人を輸送するだけでいいんです。 それはただの気楽な役柄だよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8690.55, "timestamp": "02:24:50", "text": "M、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8693.51, "timestamp": "02:24:53", "text": "撃つだけでいいんだよ。"}]